{"version":1,"key":"card:517","content":{"id":517,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"算数基本定理，又称为正整数的唯一分解定理，内容如下："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个大于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的自然数，要么本身就是质数，要么可以写为两个或以上的质数的积，而且这些质因子按大小排列之后，写法仅有一种方式。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这表示质数是乘法的基本元素。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证明："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存在性"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用数学归纳法。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n = 2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n = 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是质数，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"2 = 2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 = 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以表示为质数的乘积"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于整数 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n(n > 2)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，假设小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的整数都可以表示为质数的乘积"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于整数 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果它是质数，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n = n","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n = n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，自然可以表示为质数的乘积；如果它是合数，根据定义它可以分解为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n = a \\cdot b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n = a \\cdot b"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"b"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 均小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，根据假设，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"b"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 均可以表示为质数的乘积，因此 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以表示为质数的乘积"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"唯一性"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用反证法。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"n","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存在两种不同的分解"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"n = p_1 p_2 \\cdots p_k \\\\\nn = q_1 q_2 \\cdots q_m","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设第一组中的某个素数 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"p_c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"p_c"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不在第二组的质数中，由于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"p_c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"p_c"}]},{"type":"formatted","tex